BT /F2 16 Tf 46.00 605.00 Td (Message Storage Service) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 46.00 568.00 Td (Message-storage-service currently has no mobile-facing REST API.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 46.00 544.00 Td (It consumes RabbitMQ events from chat-service and stores private messages/status updates.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 46.00 529.00 Td (Mobile clients receive messages and statuses through chat-service WebSocket subscriptions.) Tj ET
BT /F2 16 Tf 46.00 500.00 Td (Health Endpoints) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 46.00 463.00 Td (Each service exposes health:) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.5 Tf 46.00 430.00 Td (GET /actuator/health) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 46.00 400.00 Td (Examples:) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.5 Tf 46.00 367.00 Td (curl "$IDENTITY_BASE_URL/actuator/health") Tj ET
BT /F3 8.5 Tf 46.00 355.00 Td (curl "$GROUP_BASE_URL/actuator/health") Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 46.00 325.00 Td (For chat health:) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.5 Tf 46.00 292.00 Td (curl "$CHAT_HTTP_BASE_URL/actuator/health") Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 46.00 262.00 Td (For internal services, port-forward before checking health:) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.5 Tf 46.00 229.00 Td (kubectl -n connect-chat port-forward svc/message-storage-service 8084:8084) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.5 Tf 46.00 217.00 Td (kubectl -n connect-chat port-forward svc/presence-service 8085:8085) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 46.00 187.00 Td (Then, in separate terminals:) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.5 Tf 46.00 154.00 Td (curl "http://localhost:8084/actuator/health") Tj ET
BT /F3 8.5 Tf 46.00 142.00 Td (curl "http://localhost:8085/actuator/health") Tj ET
BT /F2 16 Tf 46.00 107.00 Td (Recommended Mobile App Flow) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 46.00 70.00 Td (1. Register user with POST /identity/auth/register.) Tj ET
endstream
