BT /F1 10.5 Tf 46.00 796.00 Td (2. Verify registration with POST /identity/auth/register/verify.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 46.00 781.00 Td (3. Store accessToken and refreshToken securely.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 46.00 766.00 Td (4. Use accessToken for group REST APIs.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 46.00 751.00 Td (5. Connect to chat WebSocket with Authorization: Bearer <accessToken>.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 46.00 736.00 Td (6. Subscribe to /user/queue/private-messages.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 46.00 721.00 Td (7. Subscribe to /user/queue/private-message-status.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 46.00 706.00 Td (8. Send private messages to /app/chat.private with recipientPhoneNumber.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 46.00 691.00 Td (9. When receiving a message as recipient, publish delivered/read acknowledgements.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 46.00 676.00 Td (10. Refresh tokens with POST /identity/auth/token/refresh before or after access token) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 46.00 661.00 Td (expiration.) Tj ET
endstream
endobj
